# the screenshot tool's own tree (`just shot` builds it with --features software,
# which is a different feature set and therefore a different unit from every other
# build here — ADR-0134's reason for the extra directories). `just clean` removes
# it; 16 GB of it was sitting untracked and one `git add -A` away from a commit.
/target-shot
# Same hazard, and it keeps coming back: one experiment, one cargo tree
# (`target-ui-refresh` for the notes sweep, `target-benchmark-*` for a perf arm).
# Two of them were 15 GB of untracked build output today.
/target-*
/.scratch
/.build
/appdata
*.pdb
.DS_Store
/dist
